# Local env backups. `local-dev/patch-env-ips.ps1` writes .env.bak on every run,
# and manual fixes leave .env.<reason>.bak files behind. These hold full Atlas
# and Redis credentials — they were previously untracked but NOT ignored, one
# `git add -A` away from being published. Never commit them.
.env.bak
.env.*.bak
*.env.bak
